{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もいちにちお疲れ様です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくれて、ありがとうございます ^^)♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "数日前の朝"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "目が覚めて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん寝たはずなのに、妙に気怠い体を一生懸命起こしました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっとの思いで、のそのそとベットから抜け出した後、ぐっと伸びて大きく深呼吸して……窓の外を見たら、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "生憎の雨でした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱりなーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京の空はどうやらご機嫌ななめだったみたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "というか、最近天気が悪い日多かったりしません？反抗期かな？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなことを思いながらも、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は1日体がだるいんだろうなあ、出かけたくないなあ、と半ば諦めながら朝の支度をしていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "逆に言うと、天気が良い日はついオシャレしてお出かけしちゃいたくなりますね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "雨の良さもあるかもしれないけれど、やっぱり私は晴れの日が好き☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(ちなみに矢田萌華は雨女)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特に、春の穏やかな晴れの日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぽかぽかしてて、けど暑すぎなくて\n冬の余韻がある涼しい風が吹いてる日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "春の匂いがする日、大好きです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして！そんな春の風物詩といえば"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『桜』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "去年上京したての頃は、東京の街を知らなくて、外を散歩する余裕もなかったので\n(散歩していたら迷子になっちゃうので)\nお花見をするどころか、桜を見ることさえ叶いませんでした( ; ; )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年もお花見をせずに終わっちゃうのかなー、なんて思っていた、とある春のよく晴れた日。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "岡本姫奈さんとお仕事が一緒になって、それだけでも幸せだったのに、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事帰り、お花見に誘ってくださったのです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobZYzOhn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あったかい陽射しと桜の下で、ただひたすらにお話してました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📷⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カメラで撮りあいっこしたり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobq3XJMU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても幸せな時間だったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobc0Jzjl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カメラで写真撮られるの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けっこう恥ずかしくてこのポーズ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最高の思い出も作って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また来年、いっしょにお花見する約束もできたので大豊作です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この出来事が、少し前のことでした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今日お散歩していたら、川沿いに桜が咲いていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日見た桜はもう半分くらい葉桜だったけど、緑色も素敵だなー、なんて思ったり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと、すぐに散ってしまうからこそ儚くて美しいんだな、とか思ったり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "風が吹いた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "桜の花びらがひらひら舞って落ちてくる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "冬がほどける音がする。"}], "source": "official"}